# ==============================================================================
# ReBorrow Frontend - Environment Variables
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust values as needed for your environment.
# Vite only exposes env vars prefixed with `VITE_` to client-side code — this
# is a Vite security feature (unprefixed vars are never bundled into the
# client, preventing accidental leakage of server-side secrets).

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# API Configuration
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL for backend API requests.
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT: Leave this UNSET (or commented out). When unset,
# lib/api.ts falls back to the relative path '/api', which Vite's dev
# server proxy (see vite.config.ts) forwards to http://localhost:5000.
# This avoids any CORS configuration being necessary during local dev.
#
# PRODUCTION: Set this to your deployed backend's absolute URL, including
# the '/api' path segment. Example:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.reborrow.app/api
#
# VITE_API_URL=